    <h2 style="text-align: center;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What does RosterWise {{ sport.name }} cover?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Every college {{ lname }} program with a published roster — {{ sport.subtext }}. Each sport ships as its own dedicated app, so everything you see is {{ lname }}, with no other-sport clutter.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Is this a subscription?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>No. RosterWise {{ sport.name }} is a one-time purchase of $40 — no monthly fees, no renewals, no ads. Pay once and get lifetime access for your athlete&rsquo;s entire recruiting journey.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How current is the roster data?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Roster data is refreshed regularly through the recruiting cycle, captured from each program&rsquo;s official athletics website — so the analysis reflects the current state of each roster.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is My RosterFit&trade;?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>A personalized scoring system. Enter your athlete&rsquo;s {{ axis }}, size, graduation year, GPA, test scores, and geographic preferences, and RosterFit scores every {{ lname }} program by how well your athlete&rsquo;s profile aligns with the program&rsquo;s actual roster. <a href="/roster-intelligence/">Learn more about our methodology.</a></p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Will it tell me which schools will recruit my athlete?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>No — and we&rsquo;re upfront about that. No tool can predict recruiting outcomes; they depend on coach communication, timing, and factors no dataset captures. RosterWise gives you the analysis to make better-informed decisions about where to focus. It&rsquo;s intelligence, not a crystal ball.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do you offer recruiting consulting or coach outreach?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>No. RosterWise is a self-service intelligence tool, not a recruiting service — because nobody knows your athlete&rsquo;s situation better than your family.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

